{
    "title": "Logo Quiz Game",
    "description": "Do you know that you see hundreds of brands' logos everywhere every day? You see brand logos at home, on your clothes, on the TV, on the street, in the newspapers... in short, everywhere! You will be surprised to see how much logo you know with the brand logo test.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to play the Logo quiz to guess the popular brands around the world? Whatever logo you call this, \"Logo Game: World Brands Quiz\" game is just for you! Test your knowledge!\r\n\r\nLogo Game is a free logo quiz where you guess popular brands with World Brands Quiz. The most up-to-date logos of 2022 are in the Logo Quiz World.\r\n\r\nIn the fun logo game, you will see world brand logos as well as movie logos, cartoon character logos, food logos, car logos, football club logos and many different logo tests. See the logo answers instantly after your guesses with the logo test game. NFL Logo Quiz and Car Logo Quiz play. See logo quiz answers now.\r\n\r\nFeatures of \u201cLogo Game: World Brands Quiz\u201d\r\n\u2022 More than 2000 popular brand logos from around the world,\r\n\u2022 One of the logo guessing games with the most up-to-date brands,\r\n\u2022 Fun categories with General Logos, Country Logos and Sector Logos sections,\r\n\u2022 Get letters to help solve the logo quiz, skip the question, unused letters, brand's country and industry information, and blurry picture clues,\r\n\u2022 Two different types of logo games by typing the brands of the logos or as multiple choice,\r\n\u2022 Win free coins and gifts every day with the wheel of luck,\r\n\u2022 Earn coins with correct logo answers. Get new free tips with these,\r\n\u2022 See how you are on the leaderboard and compete with other countries,\r\n\u2022 Logo test country sections and special logos for United States brands, United Kingdom brands,\r\n\u2022 English Logo Game and 29 different language support,\r\n\u2022 Quality and up-to-date logo images,\r\n\u2022 Small size of the application,\r\nAnd all this is completely free.\r\nLogo game app is a great quiz game for the whole family! Go on to compete with your friends by having fun with the easy and difficult levels of the logo game\u2026\r\n\r\n\" Logo Game: World Brands Quiz\" Sections\r\n\r\nGeneric Logo Game\r\nFind world brand logos in 50 levels based on their popularity in logo quiz world.\r\n\r\nIndustry Logos Game\r\n16 industry-based logos (Technology, Apparel, Automobile, Retail, Banking, Football, Telecom, Food, Engineering and Construction, Cosmetics and Personal Care, Media, Airlines, Oil and Gas, Beverages, Toys, Restaurants)\r\n\r\nCountry Brands Logo Game\r\nCustom brand logos for 16 countries (United States, United Kingdom, France, Germany, Japan, Italy, China, Spain, Turkiye, Switzerland, Sweden, Brazil, Netherlands, Mexico, Canada, Russia)\r\n\r\nOptional Logo Game\r\nGuess the world brand logos in 10 chapters with multiple choice answers in the logo game world.\r\n\r\nFrequently updated application, new brand logos coming soon\u2026\r\n\r\nAll logos used or presented in the \u201cLogo Game: World Brands Quiz\u201d game are copyrighted and/or trademarks of their respective businesses. The use of low-resolution graphics for descriptive purposes is considered acceptable under copyright.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you know that you see hundreds of brands&#39; logos everywhere every day? You see brand logos at home, on your clothes, on the TV, on the street, in the newspapers... in short, everywhere! You will be surprised to see how much logo you know with the brand logo test.<br><br>Are you ready to play the Logo quiz to guess the popular brands around the world? Whatever logo you call this, &quot;Logo Game: World Brands Quiz&quot; game is just for you! Test your knowledge!<br><br>Logo Game is a free logo quiz where you guess popular brands with World Brands Quiz. The most up-to-date logos of 2022 are in the Logo Quiz World.<br><br>In the fun logo game, you will see world brand logos as well as movie logos, cartoon character logos, food logos, car logos, football club logos and many different logo tests. See the logo answers instantly after your guesses with the logo test game. NFL Logo Quiz and Car Logo Quiz play. See logo quiz answers now.<br><br>Features of \u201cLogo Game: World Brands Quiz\u201d<br>\u2022 More than 2000 popular brand logos from around the world,<br>\u2022 One of the logo guessing games with the most up-to-date brands,<br>\u2022 Fun categories with General Logos, Country Logos and Sector Logos sections,<br>\u2022 Get letters to help solve the logo quiz, skip the question, unused letters, brand&#39;s country and industry information, and blurry picture clues,<br>\u2022 Two different types of logo games by typing the brands of the logos or as multiple choice,<br>\u2022 Win free coins and gifts every day with the wheel of luck,<br>\u2022 Earn coins with correct logo answers. Get new free tips with these,<br>\u2022 See how you are on the leaderboard and compete with other countries,<br>\u2022 Logo test country sections and special logos for United States brands, United Kingdom brands,<br>\u2022 English Logo Game and 29 different language support,<br>\u2022 Quality and up-to-date logo images,<br>\u2022 Small size of the application,<br>And all this is completely free.<br>Logo game app is a great quiz game for the whole family! Go on to compete with your friends by having fun with the easy and difficult levels of the logo game\u2026<br><br>&quot; Logo Game: World Brands Quiz&quot; Sections<br><br>Generic Logo Game<br>Find world brand logos in 50 levels based on their popularity in logo quiz world.<br><br>Industry Logos Game<br>16 industry-based logos (Technology, Apparel, Automobile, Retail, Banking, Football, Telecom, Food, Engineering and Construction, Cosmetics and Personal Care, Media, Airlines, Oil and Gas, Beverages, Toys, Restaurants)<br><br>Country Brands Logo Game<br>Custom brand logos for 16 countries (United States, United Kingdom, France, Germany, Japan, Italy, China, Spain, Turkiye, Switzerland, Sweden, Brazil, Netherlands, Mexico, Canada, Russia)<br><br>Optional Logo Game<br>Guess the world brand logos in 10 chapters with multiple choice answers in the logo game world.<br><br>Frequently updated application, new brand logos coming soon\u2026<br><br>All logos used or presented in the \u201cLogo Game: World Brands Quiz\u201d game are copyrighted and/or trademarks of their respective businesses. The use of low-resolution graphics for descriptive purposes is considered acceptable under copyright.",
